<title>PHILIPPINES: Basketball-Shell wins sixth game of PBA finals.</title>
<headline>Basketball-Shell wins sixth game of PBA finals.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of Game Six of the Philippine Basketball Association second conference finals played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Formula Shell beat Alaska Milk 88-85 (42-37)</p>
<p>(Best-of-seven series tied at 3-3).</p>
</text>
